Set move_delay to 100.
Please open a window with width 800 and height 600 titled "Syl Graphical Snake".
Repeat while the window is not closing:
    Begin drawing.
    Clear the background to "black".
    If game_over is 0:
        If w key is pressed:
            If (dir_y == 0):
                Set next_dir_x to 0.
                Set next_dir_y to (0 - 1).
        If s key is pressed:
            If (dir_y == 0):
                Set next_dir_x to 0.
                Set next_dir_y to 1.
        If a key is pressed:
            If (dir_x == 0):
                Set next_dir_x to (0 - 1).
                Set next_dir_y to 0.
        If d key is pressed:
            If (dir_x == 0):
                Set next_dir_x to 1.
                Set next_dir_y to 0.
        Set cur_time to current time.
        Set time_diff to (cur_time - last_move_time).
        If (time_diff > move_delay):
            Set last_move_time to cur_time.
            Set dir_x to next_dir_x.
            Set dir_y to next_dir_y.
            If (snake_len > 49):
                Set s50_x to s49_x.
                Set s50_y to s49_y.
